Add the ``add_attachment_content``, ``add_attachment_file``, ``list_attachments`` and ``delete_attachment`` MCP tools, so agents can attach files to user stories, tasks, issues, epics and wiki pages (for wiki pages ``ref`` is the page's id). ``add_attachment_file`` reads only inside the directory set in ``TAIGA_MCP_UPLOAD_DIR`` and is not registered when it is unset; size limits are configurable with ``TAIGA_MCP_MAX_CONTENT_BYTES`` and ``TAIGA_MCP_MAX_FILE_BYTES``.
